description: Increment the browser extension version for every changed release artifact
alwaysApply: true
---

# Extension versioning

- Never rebuild or deliver changed Firefox or Chrome extension artifacts under an already used version.
- Before a release build containing repository changes, increment the SemVer patch version.
- Keep `browser-extension/manifest.json` and `browser-extension/manifest.chrome.json` on the same version.
- Update version assertions, the project version in `docs/threat-model.md`, and `RELEASE_NOTES.md` in the same change.
- Run the relevant tests and `tools/build_extension.py`, then report the resulting version and artifact paths.
